      "content": "HIGH STREET 1. 5252                                                   (East Side)                                                   Nos 105 and 107 TL 0507 1/156             20.12.67. II                        GV 2. Early C19 remodelling of earlier house.  Former Royal Oak Inn, recorded 1523, licensed later C16.  Red brick, Welsh slated roof.  3 storeys, stucco ground floor with 2 single light sash windows.  2 triple light sash windows to each upper floor.  Earlier back elevation.  House of Correction in C18. Nos 103 to 111 (odd) and 107A form a group. Listing NGR: TL0549707994"
